{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"五变 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"五变第四十六","date_published":"2025-09-05T18:01:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-28T02:31:10Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-46/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-46/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["五变"],"summary":"五变，原指五种变化。因文中是以五种不同质的树木遇到五种气候异常变化时的表现为例，说明人体质不同而发生不同疾病的道理，故称为\u0026quot;五变\u0026quot;。","content_html":"五变，原指五种变化。因文中是以五种不同质的树木遇到五种气候异常变化时的表现为例，说明人体质不同而发生不同疾病的道理，故称为\u0026quot;五变\u0026quot;。"}]}